        "date": "2026-11-25T21:19:08Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(ui): make the ai_chat cancel test wait on the cancel flag, not a 5 s clock\n\nThe blocked test worker gave up after 5 s from turn start. A slow machine could\nstall the UI thread longer, so the cancel never reached the worker. The worker\nnow waits for the flag and only a 120 s hang guard remains. A pin test stalls\n6 s before the Cancel click.\n\nFixes #4021\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
